{"team":"CHI","col":"#F1873B","identity":"run-heavy","funnel":"run-funnel","plays_pg":64.3,"adot":8.5,"report_html":"<div class=\"report\"><h2>Bleed the Clock</h2><p>The WR2 is unusually involved here \u2014 <strong>19%</strong> of targets (league ~15%), meaning there's bankable volume beyond the top receiver.</p><h3>The Offensive Blueprint</h3><p>Their run game attacks the perimeter \u2014 <strong>31% of carries hit the edge</strong> (league ~25%), an outside-zone lean that rewards speed backs and can boom for chunk gains.</p><p>They're a heavy under-center team (61% shotgun vs ~68%) \u2014 a pro-style, run-committed structure.</p><p>When they fall behind they abandon the run entirely \u2014 58% pass while trailing, so their pass-catchers have huge comeback-script ceilings.</p><p>They play fast \u2014 <strong>64 snaps a game</strong> (league ~61), and the extra volume is a rising tide that lifts everyone's counting stats.</p><h3>In the Red Zone</h3><p>Inside the 20 they lean run-heavy, passing <strong>52%</strong> of the time, funnelling touchdown equity to <strong>D'Andre Swift</strong>.</p><h2>Defense \u2014 The Run Comes Free</h2><p>They surrender <strong>134 rushing</strong> and <strong>239 passing</strong> yards per game (league ~120 / ~230). The run moves against them \u2014 <strong>target opposing RB1s</strong>.</p><p>They give up deep shots (21% of throws travel 15+ vs ~19%) \u2014 big-play WR upside against them.</p><p>They leak <strong>RB rushing TDs</strong> (0.56/game vs ~0.46) \u2014 an anytime-TD spot to attack.</p><p>They leak <strong>WR1 receiving TDs</strong> (0.47/game vs ~0.38) \u2014 an anytime-TD spot to attack.</p><h2>The Betting Angles</h2><p>Bottom line: back <strong>D'Andre Swift</strong>'s rushing volume in favored/positive scripts; their pass-catchers have massive ceilings in comeback scripts (fade-material as underdogs); <strong>opposing RB1s</strong> smash on the ground and at the goal line.</p><p><em>Built on 2024\u201325 data; the profile rebuilds through the season as the current staff and roster set their own tendencies.</em></p></div>","depth":{"QB":[{"name":"Caleb Williams","slot":"QB1","starter":true,"td":8,"props":{"Comp":19.38,"Att":32.44,"Pass Yds":215.38,"Pass TD":1.38,"INT":0.46,"Rush Yds":20.99}}],"RB":[{"name":"D'Andre Swift","slot":"RB1","starter":true,"td":33,"props":{"Rush Att":11.92,"Rush Yds":52.71,"Tgt":2.47,"Rec":1.92,"Rec Yds":14.41}},{"name":"Kyle Monangai","slot":"RB2","starter":true,"td":22,"props":{"Rush Att":7.79,"Rush Yds":34.61,"Tgt":3.04,"Rec":2.16,"Rec Yds":18.7}},{"name":"Roschon Johnson","slot":"RB3","starter":false,"td":13,"props":{"Rush Att":1.6,"Rush Yds":6.11,"Tgt":1.85,"Rec":1.28,"Rec Yds":8.13}},{"name":"Salvon Ahmed","slot":"RB4","starter":false,"td":14,"props":{"Rush Att":2.43,"Rush Yds":7.81,"Tgt":2.99,"Rec":1.85,"Rec Yds":13.51}}],"WR":[{"name":"Rome Odunze","slot":"WR1","starter":true,"td":19,"props":{"Tgt":5.45,"Rec":2.93,"Rec Yds":41.26,"Rec TD":0.22}},{"name":"Luther Burden III","slot":"WR2","starter":true,"td":15,"props":{"Tgt":4.72,"Rec":3.27,"Rec Yds":43.0,"Rec TD":0.17}},{"name":"Kalif Raymond","slot":"WR3","starter":true,"td":8,"props":{"Tgt":2.43,"Rec":1.52,"Rec Yds":18.77,"Rec TD":0.08}},{"name":"Zavion Thomas","slot":"WR4","starter":false,"td":10,"props":{"Tgt":2.42,"Rec":1.33,"Rec Yds":16.04,"Rec TD":0.1}},{"name":"Jahdae Walker","slot":"WR5","starter":false,"td":18,"props":{"Tgt":3.21,"Rec":2.05,"Rec Yds":26.86,"Rec TD":0.2}}],"TE":[{"name":"Colston Loveland","slot":"TE1","starter":true,"td":32,"props":{"Tgt":8.52,"Rec":5.76,"Rec Yds":70.72,"Rec TD":0.42}},{"name":"Cole Kmet","slot":"TE2","starter":false,"td":14,"props":{"Tgt":3.04,"Rec":1.88,"Rec Yds":18.86,"Rec TD":0.16}},{"name":"Sam Roush","slot":"TE3","starter":false,"td":10,"props":{"Tgt":2.42,"Rec":1.5,"Rec Yds":14.98,"Rec TD":0.12}}]},"schedule":[{"week":1,"ha":"@","opp":"CAR","opp_col":"#3AC7F0","gid":"2026_01_CHI_CAR","spread":"\u22122.5","proj":"24\u201321","win":true},{"week":2,"